' =====================================
ADMIN --> BTN_CAPTURE : Click "Capture"
BTN_CAPTURE --> GRAPHQL : GraphQL Mutation
BTN_REFUND --> GRAPHQL : GraphQL Mutation

note on link
  **Admin UI → GraphQL:**

  mutation {
    capturePayment(input: {
      orderId: "ORD-123"
      idempotencyKey: "admin-capture-123-20251009"
    }) {
      success
